WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.620
chuckle can you talk about fear of
failure in how to overcome it fear of

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:15.509
failure
so obviously fear of failure can can

00:00:15.509 --> 00:00:20.910
keep you from taking risk and it can
leave you just sitting there paralyzed

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:32.219
into not taking any action at all and
obviously that's bad but I don't

00:00:32.219 --> 00:00:41.300
actually want you to overcome the fear
of failure I want I want you to be

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:49.860
afraid of failure fear of failure is
good fear of failure will keep you up at

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:58.559
night planning and rehearsing and going
over contingencies fear of failure will

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:08.580
keep you training hard it'll stop you
from cutting corners fear fear of

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:15.000
failure will keep you working and
thinking and striving and relentlessly

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:21.200
trying to be more prepared for battle

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:34.650
so I want you to be afraid of failing
I fear failure but more important I want

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:41.909
you to be horrified I want you to be
terrified of sitting on your ass and

00:01:41.909 --> 00:01:49.680
doing nothing that is what I want you to
be afraid of of waking up in six days or

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:57.509
six weeks or six years or sixty years in
being no closer to your goal you've made

00:01:57.509 --> 00:02:07.380
no progress that
is the horror that is the nightmare that

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:27.550
is what you need to be truly afraid of
being stagnant so get up and go take the

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:38.310
risk take the gamble take the first step
take action and don't let another day

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:42.360
slip by

